<title>FRANCE: Lafarge says early 97 sales encouraging.</title>
<headline>Lafarge says early 97 sales encouraging.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cement and building materials group Lafarge said on Wednesday that sales activity in the starting months of this year was in line with its forecasts for sales and results this year.</p>
<p>The group said in a statement issued as it held its annual shareholders meeting that, &quot;the growth in sales in the first quarter was particularly encouraging, and even more so given the fact that the month of April confirmed this favourable trend&quot;.</p>
</text>
